# Campaign paths. Status 200 is a rewrite, not a redirect: Cloudflare serves index.html
# while the browser keeps showing /ig or /fb. That is the whole point, because Web
# Analytics reports location.pathname, so these land in the Path tab as separate rows.
# A 301 or 302 here would rewrite the URL to "/" and the split would be lost.
#
# Deliberately a rewrite rather than copies of index.html in /ig/ and /fb/: one landing
# page, one place to edit. Copies would need every future change made three times.
#
# index.html carries <link rel="canonical"> pointing at the root, so all three paths tell
# search engines the same thing and nothing reads as duplicate content.

/ig     /index.html  200
/ig/    /index.html  200
/fb     /index.html  200
/fb/    /index.html  200
